      "start_time": 62.63,
      "end_time": 64.55
    },
    {
      "text": "It's very cold here where I am.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Goldberg",
      "start_time": 64.55,
      "end_time": 66.15
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I heard you guys had like, I don't know, 6, 15, 16 inches of snow last week.",
