      "start_time": 74.07,
      "end_time": 74.63
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 74.87,
      "end_time": 75.43
    },
    {
      "text": "It was terrible.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Goldberg",
      "start_time": 75.59,
      "end_time": 76.39
    },
    {
      "text": "They're still, they're still clearing out snow piles with heavy equipment.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Goldberg",
      "start_time": 76.39,
      "end_time": 80.39
    },
    {
      "text": "But I'm heading to Dubai in a couple of hours.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Goldberg",
      "start_time": 81.99,
      "end_time": 84.23
    },
    {
      "text": "So I, I think the.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Goldberg",
      "start_time": 84.23,
      "end_time": 85.51
    },
    {
      "text": "You'll be sweating.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 89.65,
      "end_time": 90.49
    },
    {
      "text": "You will need an air conditioner probably like.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 90.49,
      "end_time": 94.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, it's great.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 94.25,
      "end_time": 97.73
    },
    {
      "text": "Is earned up gonna be joining, I think.",
