      "end_time": 100.61
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Goldberg",
      "start_time": 101.73,
      "end_time": 102.09
    },
    {
      "text": "No, it's just, it'll just be me for right now, but that's fine.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Goldberg",
      "start_time": 102.09,
      "end_time": 105.45
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, he'll.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Goldberg",
      "start_time": 105.45,
      "end_time": 106.01
    },
    {
      "text": "He'll pick it up later.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Goldberg",
      "start_time": 106.01,
      "end_time": 106.93
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you give him access to the data room for this one as well?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Goldberg",
      "start_time": 106.93,
      "end_time": 110.85
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 111.73,
      "end_time": 112.21
    },
    {
      "text": "So basically we have like the process where we, we give the access right after calls.",
