      "end_time": 156.25
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll figure out.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Goldberg",
      "start_time": 156.25,
      "end_time": 156.97
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean if, if I know generally where she is in New York City, I can, I'll figure out a venue.",
